Hello,

With replicated model i.e. f(A, ...replicate = sex) and f(B, ...replicate = sex), random effects are automatically produced for both sex in summary.random. But with linear combs for A and B, only ONE linear combs are automatically created for reference category of sex..how do I obtained linear combs for other categories of replicated model?

thanks

